{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026oxD4jh0cZ91795407538.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>大埔龍尾村蔡天鳳肢解案續審。</p><p></p><p>第43日審訊，先由鄺港傑代表大律師盤問鄺港智與蔡天鳳、譚方駿關係。鄺港智承認與蔡天鳳離婚後，2023年仍有性關係。他指譚方駿可能知道，但無反對，他形容三人像家人，但同時又很複雜及奇怪。</p><p></p><p>對於鄺球及蔡天鳳的關係，鄺港智稱蔡天鳳本身不喜歡鄺球。就出售加多利山物業，鄺球曾指如果蔡天鳳不讓他跟孫兒見面，其他事不會再配合，鄺港智就補充包括賣樓手續等。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-23T04:49:55.578137+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":186,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T03:52:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T00:36:37.530047+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-23T04:43:21.247131+00:00","content_hash":"495cedf5e8aae4f2b8ea6397808cb2c366d616fdc9732164568a3cf0634fea5b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-23T04:49:55.578137+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}